# Secrets. `.env.example` is documentation and stays tracked; every other
# .env variant is local-only. Server-only keys (SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY,
# ADZUNA_APP_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, NVIDIA_API_KEY) must never be committed
# and must never be given a VITE_ prefix — see server/lib/supabase.ts.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

*.local
.tmp-*
*.tsbuildinfo
